  "body": "Some homes look good. The best ones feel good to live in. At Upper Gills, sunny spaces, thoughtful details and quality workmanship come together in a development of just two freehold homes.\r\n\r\nPicture friends gathered around the kitchen’s waterfall benchtop, dinner underway and the extra-wide sliders open to the rear deck. It’s a great layout for young families. The kids can play on the level lawn while you get dinner ready, and there’s room on the deck for everyone to eat together on a warm evening.\r\n\r\nDesigned for warm, healthy living, each home offers three bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms, including a spacious ensuite that makes the morning routine feel a little more indulgent. Fully tiled bathrooms and coordinated gunmetal finishes throughout give the interiors a polished, cohesive feel.\r\n\r\nThere’s practicality behind the style, too. Ample storage helps keep daily life tidy, and the larger-than-standard garage gives you extra space for bikes, scooters or a workbench. Easy off-street parking adds convenience.\r\nCrisp white exteriors and soft neutral accents create lasting street appeal, and the homes enjoy peaceful outlooks.\r\n\r\nBuilt by Walker Homes, for locals, by locals. Whether you’re buying your first home, raising a young family or ready to downsize, you’ll enjoy low-maintenance living within easy reach of Howick Village and Half Moon Bay Marina.",
